<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">25062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Three insurgent Democrats have unseated pro-Israel incumbents in New York's House primaries... and for the first time the shift reached working-class, majority-minority districts, not just affluent progressive enclaves.</s> <s>Each winner ran against the American Israel Public Affairs Committee and against United States arms sales to Israel.</s> <s>Unconditional support for Israel, once a safe position in Democratic politics, no longer reliably wins.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan, an anti-terrorism court has sentenced the rights organiser Doctor Mahrang Baloch to life in prison for peaceful advocacy.</s> <s>Balochistan answered with a province-wide general strike that shuttered Quetta, while the Human Rights Commission of Pakistan and four mainstream parties demanded her release.</s> <s>Terrorism courts built to try armed insurgents are increasingly being turned on unarmed activists.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Police in Muzaffarnagar have freed twelve migrant workers held captive in a factory with dogs, whips, and wages that never came.</s> <s>The owner had promised twelve thousand rupees a month to labourers drawn from eight Indian states and Nepal, then paid them nothing.</s> <s>Debt bondage, a practice older than India's independence, still surfaces in its most populous state — and the owner has absconded.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombia has elected the Trump-aligned hard-liner Abelardo de la Espriella, who's vowed to stop negotiating with guerrilla armies.</s> <s>He takes office in August, inheriting sixty years of unbroken conflict in which Marxist rebels, right-wing paramilitaries, and drug networks coexist.</s> <s>Whether militarisation shrinks the cartels or splinters them into more violent fragments is the question his predecessors never solved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Cairo, the journalist Haider Qandil vanished from his Giza office on Monday evening, one of at least eight Shia Muslims swept up before Ashura.</s> <s>Egypt's Shia minority numbers less than one percent of the population, and his family says security forces seized even a New Zealand citizen at home.</s> <s>The Journalists Syndicate is still searching for where the state has taken him.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Israeli drone killed two people near Kfar Reman in southern Lebanon on Wednesday, the first deaths since a fragile calm took hold on Sunday.</s> <s>Israel's defence minister said his troops won't leave Lebanon even if Washington demands it, blocking the very condition Iran set for talks.</s> <s>The ceasefire holds on paper while the killing continues on the ground.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Two state-owned banks in Kyrgyzstan have dropped one hundred and thirty-one clients to satisfy European concerns over goods re-exported to Russia.</s> <s>The move shows how Western secondary sanctions radiate outward, forcing a small Central Asian economy to police its own firms.</s> <s>The excluded companies haven't been named — Bishkek wants Brussels to see action, not the details.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Germany has scrapped six flagship frigates, and shares in the arms maker Rheinmetall fell seventeen percent.</s> <s>Software that wouldn't talk between a Dutch builder and German shipyards drove the cost from five billion euros to more than eighteen.</s> <s>Europe's largest economy is rearming fast, yet can't make its own defence contracts work.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Leaked documents reveal that a former Mossad chief, Danny Yatom, trained a strike force in mineral-rich eastern Congo back in twenty-thirteen.</s> <s>The papers tie a former Israeli prime minister and the late Jeffrey Epstein to privatised intelligence sales in the Kivu region.</s> <s>The company involved still operates in central Africa, and no one has faced any accountability.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Back-to-back earthquakes of magnitude seven point two and seven point five struck near Caracas on Wednesday, collapsing buildings and shutting the main airport.</s> <s>Venezuela declared a state of emergency, with fifteen people still trapped in Falcon state hours later and refineries just kilometres from the epicentre.</s> <s>The twin shallow quakes near the capital compound a structural and energy risk the country can ill afford.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A kilometre-wide asteroid named nineteen-ninety-seven N-C-one passes Earth on Saturday at more than six times the distance to the Moon.</s> <s>The European Space Agency calls it potentially hazardous by classification, yet its models show no impact risk for a hundred years.</s> <s>Stargazers with binoculars can catch it from both hemispheres, if a bright Moon doesn't wash it out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kenya hosted the first African edition of the global ocean summit, where five thousand delegates pledged six point four billion dollars but signed few binding declarations.</s> <s>Only a handful of governments backed commitments on deep-sea mining and coral reefs.</s> <s>Observers say the three hundred and twenty pledges mean little without enforcement — and none was attached.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Snap has unveiled augmented-reality glasses that cost two thousand one hundred and ninety-five dollars and weigh one hundred and thirty-two grams, roughly three times a normal pair.</s> <s>Reviewers found they freeze the moment a wearer looks away from a target, and investors urged the chief executive to cancel the product outright.</s> <s>Snap plans to ship in four months anyway — a reality check on the consumer AI-glasses race.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Europol and Microsoft have seized more than three hundred servers underpinning three malware operations across Europe.</s> <s>Microsoft framed the takedown as striking the cybercrime supply chain — the shared infrastructure that unskilled operators simply rent.</s> <s>No arrests were announced, and rented infrastructure tends to regrow faster than courts can move.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Rockstar's eighty-dollar physical box for Grand Theft Auto Six will contain no disc, only a download code.</s> <s>The discless format ends resale, blocks pre-launch leaks, and quietly converts a purchase into a revocable licence.</s> <s>Pre-orders open Wednesday, and the box art won't disclose the missing disc before buyers commit.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>